{
  "id": "SCR-alerts",
  "title": "Alertas",
  "description": "Alert acknowledgement log (Module G, J4): every AlertEvent fired by the 8 AlertRule types, with scope, subject link, notified recipients and acknowledgement trail. Group admin reviews unacknowledged alerts first and acknowledges each one inline.",
  "route": "/alertas",
  "roles": [
    "group_admin"
  ],
  "template": "tpl.workspace-list",
  "i18n": {
    "es-EC": {
      "title": "Alertas",
      "subtitle": "Lo que el sistema detectó y quién ya lo revisó"
    }
  },
  "meta": {
    "owner": "fcostudios__smp",
    "release": "R1"
  },
  "accessibility": {
    "lang": "es-EC",
    "ariaLandmarks": true
  },
  "layout": {
    "kind": "page",
    "titleBar": {
      "subtitle": "Lo que el sistema detectó y quién ya lo revisó",
      "tabs": [
        {
          "id": "tab-sin-reconocer",
          "label": "Sin reconocer",
          "badge": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "tab-todas",
          "label": "Todas",
          "badge": "12"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "btn_configurar_reglas",
          "label": "Configurar reglas",
          "variant": "secondary",
          "navigate_to": "SCR-settings"
        }
      ]
    },
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "alerts_table",
        "type": "data-table",
        "title": "Registro de alertas",
        "description": "Cada alerta muestra su regla, alcance y asunto. Reconócela cuando ya la hayas revisado: queda registrado quién y cuándo. El enlace del asunto es dinámico por tipo de regla: approval_aging/blocked_no_seat/provisioning_failure/invite_unaccepted → SCR-request-detail; low_pool → SCR-pools; sync_stale/credential_failure → SCR-credentials; register_drift → SCR-exceptions (el enlace vive en la celda, no en la fila).",
        "table": {
          "rowKey": "id",
          "initialSort": {
            "columnId": "fired_at",
            "direction": "desc"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "fired_at",
              "header": "Disparada",
              "type": "datetime",
              "sortable": true
            },
            {
              "id": "type",
              "header": "Tipo",
              "type": "badge",
              "sortable": true
            },
            {
              "id": "scope",
              "header": "Alcance",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "id": "subject_ref",
              "header": "Asunto",
              "type": "link",
              "link": {
                "dynamic_per_type": {
                  "approval_aging": "SCR-request-detail",
                  "blocked_no_seat": "SCR-request-detail",
                  "provisioning_failure": "SCR-request-detail",
                  "invite_unaccepted": "SCR-request-detail",
                  "low_pool": "SCR-pools",
                  "sync_stale": "SCR-credentials",
                  "credential_failure": "SCR-credentials",
                  "register_drift": "SCR-exceptions"
                },
                "param_source": "row.subject_ref"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "notified",
              "header": "Notificados",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "id": "acknowledged_by",
              "header": "Reconocida por",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "id": "acknowledged_at",
              "header": "Reconocida el",
              "type": "datetime"
            }
          ],
          "rowActions": [
            {
              "id": "act_reconocer",
              "label": "Reconocer",
              "variant": "primary",
              "action": "server_action:ackAlert",
              "visibleWhen": "row.acknowledged_at == null",
              "confirm": {
                "title": "Reconocer alerta",
                "body": "Vas a marcar esta alerta como revisada. Quedará registrado tu usuario y la hora."
              },
              "onSuccess": {
                "toast": "Alerta reconocida. Gracias por revisarla.",
                "refresh": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "rows": [
          {
            "id": "al-001",
            "fired_at": "21/07/2026 09:14",
            "type": "Cupo bajo",
            "scope": "Org: Org central Claude Enterprise",
            "subject_ref": "Cupo disponible: 3 licencias (piso: 5)",
            "notified": "vgordillo@corporativo.ec",
            "acknowledged_by": "—",
            "acknowledged_at": "—"
          },
          {
            "id": "al-002",
            "fired_at": "21/07/2026 07:02",
            "type": "Bloqueada: sin licencia disponible",
            "scope": "Compañía: Kickoff",
            "subject_ref": "Solicitud de María Fernanda Yépez — Bloqueada: sin licencia disponible",
            "notified": "vgordillo@corporativo.ec, aprobador Kickoff",
            "acknowledged_by": "—",
            "acknowledged_at": "—"
          },
          {
            "id": "al-003",
            "fired_at": "20/07/2026 16:40",
            "type": "Aprobación demorada",
            "scope": "Compañía: Opina",
            "subject_ref": "Solicitud de Jorge Cevallos — Pendiente de aprobación (26 h)",
            "notified": "aprobador Opina",
            "acknowledged_by": "Verónica Gordillo",
            "acknowledged_at": "21/07/2026 08:05"
          },
          {
            "id": "al-004",
            "fired_at": "19/07/2026 03:15",
            "type": "Sincronización desactualizada",
            "scope": "Global",
            "subject_ref": "Datos de uso con más de 48 h de retraso (Right Angle Media, PPM, Focus)",
            "notified": "vgordillo@corporativo.ec",
            "acknowledged_by": "Verónica Gordillo",
            "acknowledged_at": "19/07/2026 09:30"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "ack_note",
        "type": "info-banner",
        "kind": "info",
        "icon": "info",
        "title": "Reconocer no resuelve",
        "content": "Reconocer una alerta solo registra que ya la viste. Si el asunto necesita acción (comprar cupo, reintentar aprovisionamiento, rotar una credencial), resuélvelo desde su pantalla: el enlace del asunto te lleva directo."
      }
    ]
  }
}